OL,3,GNEWSAThousands oppose huge #10bn data  
OL,4,Acentre                                 
OL,6,FThousands of people have signed a      
OL,7,Fpetition opposing plans for a #10bn    
OL,8,Fdata centre close to a town.           
OL,10,FDeveloper Tract wants to build the     
OL,11,F13-building giant, which will be called
OL,12,FStockton-on-Tees Technology Park, on   
OL,13,Ffields to the west of the Teesside     
OL,14,Ftown.                                  
OL,16,FStockton's Conservative MP Matt Vickers
OL,17,Fstarted the petition, which he said had
OL,18,Fso far gathered 4,000 signatures,      
OL,19,Fopposing the plan and called on Tract  
OL,20,Fto build the plant on brownfield land. 
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
