OL,3,GNEWSAThousands oppose huge #10bn data  
OL,4,Acentre                                 
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Tract said it had   
OL,7,Flooked at brownfield sites in the Tees 
OL,8,FValley but "not identified a specific  
OL,9,Fbrownfield site in Stockton that has   
OL,10,Fbeen demonstrated to meet all the      
OL,11,Frequirements for this proposal".       
